      432.35
    ],
    "text": "to amend the Penal Code (Chapter 19)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      238.15,
      335.83,
      360.43,
      344.9
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.23,
      355.63,
      455.38,
      404.3
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 53 of the Penal Code (Chapter 19) and the legaleffect of the amendment is to make provisions to state that sentence of death shall not bepronounced on or recorded against any person who is under the age of eighteen years, atthe time of the commission of an offence by such person and to detain him in a detentioninstitution in lieu of sentencing him to death.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,BoldItalic",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      230.13,
      166.97,
      402.89,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "1Penal Code (Amendment)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Italic",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      203.09,
      234.57,
      214.43
    ],
    "text": "L.D.\u2014O. 12/2021",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      193.29,
      227.69,
      370.29,
      239.03
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PENAL CODE (CHAPTER 19)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      252.29,
      401.9,
      275.99
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      289.25,
      401.89,
      312.83
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Penal Code (Amendment)Act, No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      326.09,
      401.86,
      349.79
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 53 of the Penal Code (Chapter 19) is herebyrepealed and the following section is substituted therefor:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      362.81,
      401.88,
      419.75
    ],
    "text": "53.(1) Sentence of death shall not bepronounced on or recorded against any personwho, is under the age of eighteen years, at thetime of the commission of an offence by suchperson.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      442.61,
      401.89,
      522.35
    ],
    "text": "(2)The Court shall, in lieu of sentencingsuch person to death, sentence him to bedetained in an institution established under anywritten law for the detention of persons underthe age of eighteen years, for a period specifiedin the sentence and subject to the provisions ofsuch written law.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      535.97,
      401.89,
      560.03
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
